{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41388","headline":"赠仰山慧度禅师 · 宋齐丘","name":"赠仰山慧度禅师","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"初闻如自解，及见胜初闻。\n两鬓堆残雪，一身披断云。\n道应齐古佛，高不揖吾君。\n稽首清凉月，萧然万象分。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋齐丘","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41388.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41388","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}